- **w₀ (position gain) = 0.0** – removes the static position‑bias that was causing a constant drift.
- **w₁ (angle gain) = 5.9** – the same positive angle gain that has proven stable in every successful run.
- **w₂ (cart‑velocity gain) = –1.0** – a stronger negative velocity feedback than the usual –0.3, helping to counteract any motion toward the limits.
